<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{% block title %}Correo Enviado - SGAHS{% endblock %}</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 128 128%22><text y=%221.2em%22 font-size=%2296%22>⚫️</text><text y=%221.3em%22 x=%220.2em%22 font-size=%2276%22 fill=%22%23fff%22>sf</text></svg>">
    {% block stylesheets %}
        {{ encore_entry_link_tags('app') }}
    {% endblock %}

    {% block javascripts %}
        {{ encore_entry_script_tags('app') }}
    {% endblock %}
</head>
<div class="container d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="min-height: 80vh;">
    <div class="row justify-content-center w-100">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-5">
            <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 rounded-3">
                <div class="card-body p-5 text-center">

                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <i class="bi bi-envelope-check-fill text-primary" style="font-size: 4rem;"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3">Revisa tu bandeja de entrada</h3>

                    <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                        Si existe una cuenta activa asociada a ese correo electrónico, acabamos de enviar un enlace seguro para restablecer tu contraseña.
                    </p>

                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border shadow-sm py-2 px-3">
                            <i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i> Este enlace expirará en {{ resetToken.expirationMessageKey|trans(resetToken.expirationMessageData, 'ResetPasswordBundle') }}.
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="alert alert-info bg-light border-info text-start fs-6 mb-4 shadow-sm">
                        <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill text-info me-2"></i> <strong>¿No recibiste el correo?</strong><br>
                        Asegúrate de revisar tu carpeta de Spam o correo no deseado.
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-grid gap-2 mt-4">
                        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn btn-primary fw-bold shadow-sm">
                            <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Volver al Inicio
                        </a>
                        <a href="{{ path('app_forgot_password_request') }}" class="btn btn-link text-decoration-none text-muted mt-2">
                            Intentar solicitarlo nuevamente
                        </a>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</html>
